	(text "R144: USB-only BQ24072T power-path; AO3401A hard reader switch; TPS63802 3V3. No Dock mux in this Base PCB." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "70000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000214"))
	(text "BQ24072T: 4.20V; ISET 2k 1%: 445mA nominal.\nEN2/EN1: reset/OFF (high-Z) 00 USB100; 01 USB500; 11 suspend.\nGPIO16 EN1; GPIO2 EN2; GPIO38 CE. Boot/USB/thermal/NTC qualification HOLD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "70000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000215"))
	(text "TPS63802: R97 FIT selects forced PWM after soft-start; R99 DNP. NEVER FIT BOTH. Feedback (27.4k+402R)/5.11k, 0.1% 10ppm: 3.22035V nominal. 0.47uH,22uF input,2x22uF output; effective C and dynamics require qualification." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "70000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000216"))
	(text "J1 PH2: two-wire PCM pack. J8: separate real pouch NTC103JT-050; 40.2k/33.2k bias,100k protective series and3.3M TS-to-GND bias. TS leakage/NTC/fault/thermal qualification HOLD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "70000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000217"))
